# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"PDF Arranger merges, splits, rearranges, rotates and crops PDF documents. "
"Everything happens in memory against the pages you can see; nothing is "
"written until you save."
msgstr ""
"PDF Arranger združuje, deli, prerazporeja, suka in obrezuje dokumente PDF. "
"Vse se dogaja v pomnilniku, na straneh, ki jih vidiš; nič se ne zapiše, "
"dokler ne shraniš."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"It is a front end for pikepdf. Page content is never rewritten — only page "
"order, geometry and composition."
msgstr ""
"To je vmesnik nad pikepdf. Vsebina strani se nikoli ne prepiše — le vrstni "
"red strani, geometrija in sestava."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Command line"
msgstr "Ukazna vrstica"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Files given on the command line are opened as one document. "
"<code>--version</code> prints the version and exits."
msgstr ""
"Datoteke, navedene v ukazni vrstici, se odprejo kot en dokument. "
"<code>--version</code> izpiše različico in konča."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py pdfarranger_qt/mainwindow.py
msgid "Reading"
msgstr "Branje"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"The application opens in <b>read mode</b>: a continuous page view for "
"reading the document rather than rearranging it. <b>View ▸ Arrange Mode</b> "
"(Ctrl+E) swaps to the thumbnail grid and back."
msgstr ""
"Program se odpre v <b>načinu branja</b>: zveznem prikazu strani za branje "
"dokumenta in ne za njegovo prerazporejanje. <b>Pogled ▸ Način "
"razporejanja</b> (Ctrl+E) preklopi na mrežo sličic in nazaj."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Reading shows the document <i>as edited</i>: rotations, crops, deletions and"
" reordering are all applied, so what you read is what you would get if you "
"saved. Page-editing commands are disabled while reading — bookmarks are the "
"exception, and are edited here and nowhere else."
msgstr ""
"Branje kaže dokument <i>tak, kot je urejen</i>: sukanja, obrezi, brisanja in"
" prerazporeditve so vsi uveljavljeni, zato je to, kar bereš, tisto, kar bi "
"dobil ob shranjevanju. Ukazi za urejanje strani so med branjem onemogočeni —"
" izjema so zaznamki, ki se urejajo tu in nikjer drugje."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"The page you are on follows you between the two modes. Switching to read "
"mode opens at the page selected in the grid, the first of them if several "
"are selected; switching back scrolls the grid to the page you were reading, "
"without disturbing what you had selected. With nothing selected, reading "
"resumes where you left off — your place in each document is remembered "
"between visits."
msgstr ""
"Stran, na kateri si, ti sledi med obema načinoma. Preklop v način branja "
"odpre stran, izbrano v mreži, prvo od njih, če jih je izbranih več; preklop "
"nazaj pomakne mrežo na stran, ki si jo bral, ne da bi motil tvoj izbor. Brez"
" izbora se branje nadaljuje tam, kjer si končal — tvoje mesto v vsakem "
"dokumentu se med obiski zapomni."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"The toolbar shows which page you are on and how many there are; type a "
"number into it to jump there, or use <b>Ctrl+G</b>."
msgstr ""
"Orodna vrstica kaže, na kateri strani si in koliko jih je; vanjo vpiši "
"številko, da skočiš tja, ali uporabi <b>Ctrl+G</b>."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>View ▸ Continuous Scroll</b> is on by default; turning it off shows one "
"page at a time. <b>View ▸ Facing Pages</b> puts two pages side by side, the "
"way a book falls open. Both settings are remembered."
msgstr ""
"<b>Pogled ▸ Zvezno drsenje</b> je privzeto vklopljeno; če ga izklopiš, se "
"kaže ena stran naenkrat. <b>Pogled ▸ Dvojna stran</b> postavi dve strani "
"drugo ob drugo, tako kot se odpre knjiga. Obe nastavitvi se zapomnita."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Moving around a document"
msgstr "Premikanje po dokumentu"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"One rule for the arrow keys: <b>the modifier decides what moves</b>. Nothing"
" scrolls the view, Option (Alt) moves the text cursor, Shift extends the "
"selection, Command (Ctrl) jumps to an edge, and Fn — Page Up, Page Down, "
"Home and End — jumps further. None of it changes according to whether a text"
" cursor happens to be on the page."
msgstr ""
"Eno pravilo za smerne tipke: <b>kaj se premakne, odloči spremenilka</b>. "
"Nobena pomika pogled, Option (Alt) premika besedilno kazalko, Shift razširja"
" izbor, Command (Ctrl) skoči na rob, Fn — Page Up, Page Down, Home in End — "
"pa skoči dlje. Nič od tega se ne spremeni glede na to, ali je na strani "
"slučajno besedilna kazalka."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Keys"
msgstr "Tipke"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Continuous"
msgstr "Zvezno"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py pdfarranger_qt/viewer.py
msgid "One page at a time"
msgstr "Ena stran naenkrat"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "scroll one line"
msgstr "pomakni za eno vrstico"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "top of the previous / next page"
msgstr "vrh prejšnje / naslednje strani"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "previous / next page"
msgstr "prejšnja / naslednja stran"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "scroll one screen"
msgstr "pomakni za en zaslon"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "start / end of the document"
msgstr "začetek / konec dokumenta"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "move the text cursor, by character or line"
msgstr "premakni besedilno kazalko, po znaku ali vrstici"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "extend the selection, by character or line"
msgstr "razširi izbor, po znaku ali vrstici"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "move the text cursor one word"
msgstr "premakni besedilno kazalko za eno besedo"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "extend the selection one word"
msgstr "razširi izbor za eno besedo"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "cursor to the start / end of the line"
msgstr "kazalka na začetek / konec vrstice"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "cursor to the start / end of the document"
msgstr "kazalka na začetek / konec dokumenta"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Add Shift to a Command or Option combination to extend the selection instead"
" of moving — <b>Shift+Command+→</b> selects to the end of the line. Adding "
"Option works by the word rather than the character. On Windows and Linux, "
"read Command as Ctrl and Option as Alt; the table is the same everywhere."
msgstr ""
"Kombinaciji s Commandom ali Optionom dodaj Shift, da izbor razširiš namesto "
"premakneš — <b>Shift+Command+→</b> izbere do konca vrstice. Dodani Option "
"deluje po besedah namesto po znakih. V sistemih Windows in Linux beri "
"Command kot Ctrl in Option kot Alt; razpredelnica je povsod enaka."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Selecting and copying text"
msgstr "Izbiranje in kopiranje besedila"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Drag across the page to select text, across page boundaries if you keep "
"going. <b>Double-click</b> selects a word. <b>Ctrl/Cmd+C</b> copies, "
"<b>Ctrl/Cmd+A</b> selects the text of the page you are on, and <b>Esc</b> "
"clears the selection. The same commands are on the right-click menu."
msgstr ""
"Povleci čez stran, da izbereš besedilo, čez meje strani, če nadaljuješ. "
"<b>Dvoklik</b> izbere besedo. <b>Ctrl/Cmd+C</b> kopira, <b>Ctrl/Cmd+A</b> "
"izbere besedilo strani, na kateri si, <b>Esc</b> pa počisti izbor. Isti "
"ukazi so v meniju desnega klika."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Shift+click</b> extends an existing selection to where you clicked. The "
"end you are moving grows out to a whole word, because a single click is an "
"imprecise way to point at one character; the end you started from stays "
"exactly where you put it. Dragging selects by character throughout, since "
"you can watch it and stop where you like."
msgstr ""
"<b>Shift+klik</b> razširi obstoječi izbor do mesta, kamor si kliknil. Konec,"
" ki ga premikaš, zraste do cele besede, ker je en sam klik nenatančen način "
"kazanja na en znak; konec, pri katerem si začel, ostane natanko tam, kamor "
"si ga postavil. Vlečenje ves čas izbira po znakih, saj mu lahko slediš in se"
" ustaviš, kjer želiš."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Clicking on text leaves a blinking <b>text cursor</b>. That is what "
"Shift+arrow extends from, and what the Option and Command combinations above"
" move. It stays where you put it — scrolling, paging and clicking off the "
"page all leave it alone — until you press Esc or open another document."
msgstr ""
"Klik v besedilo pusti utripajočo <b>besedilno kazalko</b>. Od nje "
"Shift+smerna tipka razširja izbor, njo pa premikajo zgornje kombinacije z "
"Optionom in Commandom. Ostane tam, kamor si jo postavil — drsenje, listanje "
"in klik zunaj strani je ne premaknejo — dokler ne pritisneš Esc ali ne "
"odpreš drugega dokumenta."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Following links"
msgstr "Sledenje povezavam"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Click a link to follow it. Links to a page in the same document jump there; "
"links to the web open in your browser. Hovering over one shows where it "
"goes, which is worth reading before you click: many links in a PDF are not "
"written by its author at all but inferred from the text, so what a link "
"points at is not always what the words appear to say."
msgstr ""
"Klikni povezavo, da ji slediš. Povezave na stran v istem dokumentu skočijo "
"tja; povezave na splet se odprejo v tvojem brskalniku. Če se z miško ustaviš"
" nad njo, pokaže, kam vodi, in to je vredno prebrati, preden klikneš: mnogih"
" povezav v dokumentu PDF ni napisal avtor, temveč so izpeljane iz besedila, "
"zato tisto, na kar povezava kaže, ni vedno tisto, kar se zdi, da besede "
"pravijo."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Only ordinary web and mail links are handed to the system — http, https, "
"mailto and ftp. A document is a file that arrived from somewhere, and "
"anything else it asks to open is refused and reported rather than acted on."
msgstr ""
"Sistemu se predajo le običajne spletne in poštne povezave — http, https, "
"mailto in ftp. Dokument je datoteka, ki je od nekod prišla, in vse drugo, "
"kar želi odpreti, se zavrne in sporoči, namesto da bi se izvedlo."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Right-clicking a link offers <b>Open Link</b> and <b>Copy Link Address</b>."
msgstr ""
"Desni klik na povezavo ponudi <b>Odpri povezavo</b> in <b>Kopiraj naslov "
"povezave</b>."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Bookmarks"
msgstr "Zaznamki"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"The sidebar shows the document's bookmarks. Click one to jump to it. "
"Everything below is on the sidebar's right-click menu, and every command can"
" be undone."
msgstr ""
"Stranski pult kaže zaznamke dokumenta. Klikni enega, da skočiš nanj. Vse "
"spodaj je v meniju desnega klika stranskega pulta, vsak ukaz pa je mogoče "
"razveljaviti."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Add Bookmark Here</b> makes one pointing at the page you are reading, "
"named after whatever text you have selected — so select a heading, then add."
" With nothing selected it is named after the page. <b>Add Child Bookmark "
"Here</b> does the same, nested under the entry you clicked."
msgstr ""
"<b>Dodaj zaznamek sem</b> ustvari zaznamek, ki kaže na stran, ki jo bereš, "
"poimenovan po besedilu, ki ga imaš izbranega — izberi torej naslov in nato "
"dodaj. Brez izbora se poimenuje po strani. <b>Dodaj podrejeni zaznamek "
"sem</b> stori isto, ugnezdeno pod vnosom, na katerega si kliknil."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Rename</b> edits the title in place. <b>Re-home to This Page</b> points "
"an existing bookmark at the page you are on, keeping its title. "
"<b>Delete</b> removes an entry and <i>promotes</i> its children into its "
"place; <b>Delete with Children</b> removes the whole branch."
msgstr ""
"<b>Preimenuj</b> uredi naslov na mestu. <b>Preusmeri na to stran</b> "
"obstoječi zaznamek usmeri na stran, na kateri si, in ohrani naslov. "
"<b>Izbriši</b> odstrani vnos in njegove podrejene <i>povzdigne</i> na "
"njegovo mesto; <b>Izbriši s podrejenimi</b> odstrani celotno vejo."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Drag entries within the sidebar to re-nest or reorder them. <b>Expand All "
"Children</b> and <b>Collapse All Children</b> open or shut a whole branch at"
" once."
msgstr ""
"Vnose vleci znotraj stranskega pulta, da jih drugače ugnezdiš ali "
"prerazporediš. <b>Razširi vse podrejene</b> in <b>Strni vse podrejene</b> "
"naenkrat odpreta ali zapreta celotno vejo."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Style</b> sets a bookmark bold or italic, or gives it a colour, as the "
"tree shows."
msgstr "<b>Slog</b> naredi zaznamek krepek ali ležeč ali mu da barvo, kot kaže drevo."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"A bookmark whose page has been deleted is <b>greyed out</b> rather than "
"removed: its title may still be worth keeping, and you can point it "
"somewhere else with Re-home. Undoing the deletion reconnects it. <b>Delete "
"Dangling Bookmarks</b> clears them all out; it leaves alone any entry that "
"points nowhere on purpose, which is a legitimate way to write a heading."
msgstr ""
"Zaznamek, čigar stran je bila izbrisana, <b>posivi</b>, namesto da bi bil "
"odstranjen: njegov naslov je morda še vedno vreden ohranitve, lahko pa ga "
"preusmeriš drugam. Razveljavitev brisanja ga znova poveže. <b>Izbriši viseče"
" zaznamke</b> jih vse pospravi; pusti pri miru vsak vnos, ki namenoma ne "
"kaže nikamor, kar je povsem legitimen način pisanja naslova."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Bookmark edits are part of the document and are written when you save, along"
" with each entry's colour and style and which branches are left open. The "
"one thing that cannot be saved is a bookmark with no page: there is no way "
"to record “points at a page that is gone”, so it comes back as a heading "
"with its title intact."
msgstr ""
"Urejanja zaznamkov so del dokumenta in se zapišejo ob shranjevanju, skupaj z"
" barvo in slogom vsakega vnosa ter s tem, katere veje ostanejo odprte. "
"Edino, česar ni mogoče shraniti, je zaznamek brez strani: ni načina, da bi "
"zapisali „kaže na stran, ki je ni več”, zato se vrne kot naslov z "
"nedotaknjenim imenom."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Arranging pages"
msgstr "Razporejanje strani"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Drag pages to reorder them. Hold <b>Ctrl</b> while dropping to copy instead "
"of move."
msgstr ""
"Strani vleci, da spremeniš njihov vrstni red. Ob spuščanju drži <b>Ctrl</b>,"
" da kopiraš namesto premakneš."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Drag pages onto another window of the application to copy them there, or use"
" ordinary copy and paste."
msgstr ""
"Strani povleci na drugo okno programa, da jih kopiraš tja, ali uporabi "
"običajno kopiraj in prilepi."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Paste As Odd/Even Pages</b> interleaves the clipboard with the document —"
" this is how two single-sided scans of a double-sided original are "
"recombined. If the second scan came off a duplex feeder it will be in "
"reverse order; use <b>Arrange ▸ Reverse Order</b> on it first."
msgstr ""
"<b>Prilepi kot lihe/sode strani</b> prepleta odložišče z dokumentom — tako "
"se dva enostranska optična prebrisa dvostranskega izvirnika spet združita. "
"Če je drugi prebris prišel iz obojestranskega podajalnika, bo v obratnem "
"vrstnem redu; nanj najprej uporabi <b>Razporedi ▸ Obrni vrstni red</b>."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"To move pages a long way, use <b>Move to Start</b>, <b>Move to End</b> or "
"<b>Move to Page…</b> rather than dragging — in a long document the far end "
"is a great deal of scrolling away. They are on the Edit menu and on the "
"right-click menu, and <b>Move to Page…</b> asks for the number the page "
"should <i>become</i>."
msgstr ""
"Za premikanje strani daleč uporabi <b>Premakni na začetek</b>, <b>Premakni "
"na konec</b> ali <b>Premakni na stran…</b> namesto vlečenja — v dolgem "
"dokumentu je drugi konec zelo daleč. So v meniju Uredi in v meniju desnega "
"klika, <b>Premakni na stran…</b> pa vpraša za številko, ki naj stran "
"<i>postane</i>."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Prefer these to cut and paste for moving. A pasted page is a <i>new</i> page"
" as far as the document is concerned, so any bookmarks pointing at the "
"original are left behind with nowhere to go. Moving keeps the page itself, "
"and its bookmarks come with it."
msgstr ""
"Pri premikanju daj tem prednost pred izreži in prilepi. Prilepljena stran je"
" z vidika dokumenta <i>nova</i> stran, zato zaznamki, ki so kazali na "
"izvirno, ostanejo brez cilja. Premikanje ohrani stran samo, njeni zaznamki "
"pa gredo z njo."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Stamping and tiling"
msgstr "Žigosanje in zlaganje"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Page ▸ Add Page Numbers…</b> and <b>Page ▸ Add Watermark…</b> draw text "
"onto the selected pages. Both add a <i>layer</i> rather than rewriting the "
"page, so both can be undone and neither touches the file you opened."
msgstr ""
"<b>Stran ▸ Dodaj številke strani…</b> in <b>Stran ▸ Dodaj vodni žig…</b> "
"narišeta besedilo na izbrane strani. Oba dodata <i>plast</i>, namesto da bi "
"prepisala stran, zato je oba mogoče razveljaviti in nobeden se ne dotakne "
"datoteke, ki si jo odprl."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Page numbers follow the arrangement, not the source document: they are "
"numbered in the order the pages are in now. <code>{n}</code> in the format "
"is the page number and <code>{total}</code> the number of pages, so "
"<code>Page {n} of {total}</code> does what it looks like."
msgstr ""
"Številke strani sledijo razporeditvi, ne izvornemu dokumentu: oštevilčene so"
" v vrstnem redu, v katerem so strani zdaj. <code>{n}</code> v obliki je "
"številka strani in <code>{total}</code> število strani, zato <code>Stran {n}"
" od {total}</code> stori to, kar je videti."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Arrange ▸ Pages per Sheet…</b> tiles several pages onto one, in reading "
"order — the printer's <i>N-up</i>. The sheet turns sideways when that lets "
"the pages come out larger, which is why two-up gives a landscape sheet and "
"four-up does not."
msgstr ""
"<b>Razporedi ▸ Strani na list…</b> zloži več strani na eno, v bralnem "
"vrstnem redu — tiskarski <i>N-up</i>. List se obrne počez, kadar strani tako"
" izidejo večje, in zato dve na list dasta ležeč list, štiri na list pa ne."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Saving a document"
msgstr "Shranjevanje dokumenta"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Optimize for the web</b> in Preferences lays the saved file out so a "
"browser can show the first page before the rest has arrived. <b>Compress</b>"
" repacks its streams and objects; how much that saves depends entirely on "
"the file, and one full of photographs will barely move."
msgstr ""
"<b>Optimiraj za splet</b> v Nastavitvah razporedi shranjeno datoteko tako, "
"da brskalnik lahko pokaže prvo stran, preden prispe ostalo. <b>Stisni</b> "
"znova zloži njene tokove in predmete; koliko se s tem prihrani, je odvisno "
"izključno od datoteke, datoteka, polna fotografij, pa se komaj premakne."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>File ▸ Remove All Metadata</b> is a switch, like Password: turn it on and"
" the next save writes a document with no title, no author and no record of "
"what produced it. Edit Properties greys out while it is on, because there "
"would be nothing to edit."
msgstr ""
"<b>Datoteka ▸ Odstrani vse metapodatke</b> je stikalo, prav tako kot Geslo: "
"vklopi ga in naslednje shranjevanje zapiše dokument brez naslova, brez "
"avtorja in brez sledi o tem, kaj ga je izdelalo. Uredi lastnosti posivi, "
"dokler je vklopljeno, ker tedaj ne bi bilo česa urejati."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>File ▸ Viewer Preferences…</b> is how the saved document asks a reader to"
" open it — with the bookmarks showing, two pages at a time, and so on. "
"Readers are free to ignore all of it. The settings are read from the file "
"you opened, so a document that already had them keeps them."
msgstr ""
"<b>Datoteka ▸ Nastavitve pregledovalnika…</b> je način, kako shranjeni "
"dokument prosi bralnika, naj ga odpre — z vidnimi zaznamki, po dve strani "
"naenkrat in tako naprej. Bralniki lahko vse to prezrejo. Nastavitve se "
"preberejo iz datoteke, ki si jo odprl, zato dokument, ki jih je že imel, jih"
" obdrži."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>File ▸ Repair Document…</b> rebuilds a damaged PDF. It works on a file "
"you pick rather than the one on screen, because the file worth repairing is "
"usually one this application cannot open properly either. It reports what it"
" found before writing anything."
msgstr ""
"<b>Datoteka ▸ Popravi dokument…</b> obnovi poškodovan PDF. Deluje na "
"datoteki, ki jo izbereš, in ne na tisti na zaslonu, ker je datoteka, ki jo "
"je vredno popraviti, običajno taka, ki je tudi ta program ne odpre pravilno."
" Preden karkoli zapiše, sporoči, kaj je našel."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Mouse"
msgstr "Miška"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "<b>Ctrl + scroll</b> — zoom"
msgstr "<b>Ctrl + drsenje</b> — povečava"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "<b>Shift + scroll</b> — scroll sideways"
msgstr "<b>Shift + drsenje</b> — drsenje vstran"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "<b>Alt + scroll</b> — scroll exactly one row"
msgstr "<b>Alt + drsenje</b> — drsenje natanko za eno vrsto"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "<b>Double-click</b> — fit the page to the window, and back"
msgstr "<b>Dvoklik</b> — prilagodi stran oknu, in nazaj"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Click and drag</b> on empty space — rubber-band select; keep scrolling to"
" extend it"
msgstr ""
"<b>Klikni in povleci</b> po praznem prostoru — izbor z okvirjem; drsi "
"naprej, da ga razširiš"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Moving around the grid"
msgstr "Premikanje po mreži"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Arrow keys</b> move between pages, <b>Page Up</b> and <b>Page Down</b> "
"move a screenful at a time, and <b>Home</b> and <b>End</b> jump to the first"
" and last page. Hold <b>Shift</b> with any of them to extend the selection."
msgstr ""
"<b>Smerne tipke</b> se premikajo med stranmi, <b>Page Up</b> in <b>Page "
"Down</b> za cel zaslon, <b>Home</b> in <b>End</b> pa skočita na prvo in "
"zadnjo stran. Ob katerikoli od njih drži <b>Shift</b>, da razširiš izbor."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Fit One Page</b> (F) scales so a whole page fits in the window and shows "
"one page per row — use it to work on a single page at a time. <b>Fit "
"Multiple Pages</b> (Shift+M) uses the same scale but lets as many pages sit "
"side by side as the window takes. <b>Fit Width</b> (Shift+F) fills the "
"window across instead, which shows the page wider but taller than the "
"window. Double-clicking the grid toggles Fit One Page on and off."
msgstr ""
"<b>Prilagodi eno stran</b> (F) umeri tako, da cela stran gre v okno, in "
"pokaže eno stran na vrsto — uporabi to, ko delaš z eno stranjo naenkrat. "
"<b>Prilagodi več strani</b> (Shift+M) uporabi isto merilo, a pusti drugo ob "
"drugi toliko strani, kolikor jih okno sprejme. <b>Prilagodi širini</b> "
"(Shift+F) namesto tega zapolni okno po širini, zaradi česar je stran širša, "
"a višja od okna. Dvoklik po mreži vklopi in izklopi Prilagodi eno stran."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"With pages selected, all three fit the selection rather than the whole "
"document."
