# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Finding text"
msgstr "Iskanje besedila"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>Find</b> selects the pages that contain the phrase and boxes each hit on "
"the thumbnail, so you can see where on the page it is. The boxes clear as "
"soon as you change the document, since the pages they were drawn for may "
"have moved."
msgstr ""
"<b>Najdi</b> izbere strani, ki vsebujejo izraz, in vsak zadetek uokviri na "
"sličici, da vidiš, kje na strani je. Okviri izginejo takoj, ko spremeniš "
"dokument, saj so se strani, za katere so bili narisani, morda premaknile."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Every shortcut can be changed in <b>Edit ▸ Preferences ▸ Keyboard "
"shortcuts</b>, where they are listed under the menu each one belongs to."
msgstr ""
"Vsako bližnjico je mogoče spremeniti v <b>Uredi ▸ Nastavitve ▸ Tipkovne "
"bližnjice</b>, kjer so navedene pod menijem, ki mu vsaka pripada."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Passwords"
msgstr "Gesla"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Opening an encrypted document asks for its password, which is remembered "
"until the document is closed."
msgstr ""
"Odpiranje šifriranega dokumenta zahteva njegovo geslo, ki se zapomni, dokler"
" dokumenta ne zapreš."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>File ▸ Password</b> encrypts the document when it is next saved. It is a "
"switch: turn it on and you are asked for a password, turn it off and the "
"next save is unencrypted. The password is never written to your settings, so"
" it applies to this session only — and if you forget it, the file cannot be "
"recovered."
msgstr ""
"<b>Datoteka ▸ Geslo</b> šifrira dokument ob naslednjem shranjevanju. To je "
"stikalo: vklopi ga in vprašan boš za geslo, izklopi ga in naslednje "
"shranjevanje bo nešifrirano. Geslo se nikoli ne zapiše v tvoje nastavitve, "
"zato velja le za to sejo — in če ga pozabiš, datoteke ni mogoče obnoviti."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"<b>File ▸ Unlock</b> goes the other way: open the document with its "
"password, choose Unlock, and the next save writes it without one. It is only"
" available when there is encryption to remove."
msgstr ""
"<b>Datoteka ▸ Odkleni</b> gre v drugo smer: dokument odprite z geslom, "
"izberite Odkleni in naslednje shranjevanje ga zapiše brez njega. Na voljo "
"le, kadar je šifriranje, ki ga je mogoče odstraniti."

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid "Files"
msgstr "Datoteke"

# machine translation, unreviewed
#: pdfarranger_qt/dialogs.py
msgid ""
"Settings are stored by Qt in the per-user location for this platform; on "
"Windows that is the registry under "
"<code>HKEY_CURRENT_USER\\Software\\pdfarranger</code>. There is no "
"configuration file to edit by hand."
msgstr ""
"Nastavitve Qt shrani na mesto, namenjeno posameznemu uporabniku na tem "
"sistemu; v sistemu Windows je to register pod "
"<code>HKEY_CURRENT_USER\\Software\\pdfarranger</code>. Nastavitvene "
"datoteke, ki bi jo urejal na roko, ni."

# machine translation, unreviewed
